<title>UK: J.Saville Gordon plans retail property sale.</title>
<headline>J.Saville Gordon plans retail property sale.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property group J. Saville Gordon Group Plc said on Thursday it planned to sell a portfolio of 147 properties, most of which are in the retail sector.</p>
<p>The company did not say how much it expected to get out of the sale but said the proceeds would be reinvested in industrial property.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
